<PostLayout
  title="CNCF and Andela Announce Partnership to Train African Tech Professionals"
  description="CNCF, Linux Foundation Education, and Andela partnered to train African technologists in Kubernetes and cloud-native fundamentals."
  category="Partnership"
  date="January 3, 2025"
  dateISO="2025-01-03"
>
  <p>
    The Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF), together with Linux
    Foundation Education, partnered with Andela to provide Kubernetes and
    cloud-native training to tens of thousands of African technologists at no
    cost to participants. The program is designed to help participants work
    toward the Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) and Certified
    Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD) certifications, opening the door
    to cloud-native career opportunities both within Africa and globally.
  </p>
  <p>
    This summary reflects a partnership announcement originally published by
    Cloud Native Africa. Read the full announcement for details, quotes, and
    background.
  </p>
</PostLayout>
